<task id="209" project="spaarke-ontology-platform-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Nightly D-170 close reads only the not-in-force policies that still have open Signals (#3014, DI-164)</title>
    <phase>12 Create-wizard lookups and composer (185 dev check fixes)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies the nightly Signal close (.cs) in BFF Signals; changes which query selects Signals to close.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>The selection decides which Signals the nightly job closes: a wrong join closes live items or leaves retired ones open; D-170, D-120, D-61 and task 204's truncation rule must survive.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>deferred-fixes-2026-11-25</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Only SignalClosureService.cs / SignalReevaluationJob.cs and their tests; no other task in the group touches them.</parallel-reason>
